{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible and approached, take and check it. Then perform specific task and move. Or scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectWeight    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectColor    /> <Action ID = MoveToTarget    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <SubTree ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
